		r.Push("||FILL A WEAPON'S XP BAR|||||DO:~FILL A WEAPON'S XP BAR~GET:~A LEVEL WAITS FOR THAT WEAPON: GUN BONSAI'S LEVEL-UP FLASH AND SOUND (WHEN ITS SETTINGS HAVE THEM) AND ITS \"LEVEL UP READY\" MESSAGE. NOTHING IS CHOSEN YET. IF GUN BONSAI'S \"CHOICES PER GUN LEVEL\" IS 0 OR 1 THE UPGRADE IS CHOSEN FOR YOU AT ONCE");
		r.Push("||PRESS THE INFO KEY WHILE A WEAPON'S LEVEL WAITS|||||DO:~PRESS THE INFO KEY WHILE A WEAPON'S LEVEL WAITS~GET:~THAT WEAPON'S LEVEL-UP SCREEN OPENS: THE WEAPON'S NAME AS THE TITLE AND UP TO FOUR CARDS, EACH ONE UPGRADE GUN BONSAI OFFERS, WITH ITS DESCRIPTION AND NEW OR THE LEVEL IT WOULD GO TO. THE MAIN HAND'S WEAPON IS SERVED FIRST, THEN THE OFF HAND'S~NEEDS:~GBOVR MENUS AND HUD: ON (DEFAULT)");
